WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.766 --> 00:00:07.900
On their way to Snowbelle City, our heroes have decided to camp out

2
00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:11.000
so they can see the Litleonid meteor shower

3
00:00:11.066 --> 00:00:13.233
on the night of the new moon.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.666
I hope I get to see a shooting star really soon.

5
00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:18.966
Pika.

6
00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:23.400
Since tonight's a new moon, I'm sure we'll get to see a lot of them.

7
00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:27.233
- Now, we'll all have to make a wish.
- What do you mean?

8
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.200
If you make a wish when you see a shooting star,

9
00:00:30.266 --> 00:00:31.800
your wish will come true.

10
00:00:31.866 --> 00:00:35.900
- Then I'm gonna make a bunch of wishes.
- I think I'll do that, too.

11
00:00:35.966 --> 00:00:37.466
Pikachu!

12
00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:42.033
Nothing so far.

13
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.966
Relax. It shouldn't be much longer.

14
00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.066
- Ah! Did you see that one?
- Huh? See what?

15
00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:54.833
- I missed it? How's that possible?
- Don't worry. There will be another.

16
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:55.733
- Pika!
- Huh?

17
00:00:58.066 --> 00:00:59.366
Wow.

18
00:00:59.433 --> 00:01:02.566
- Is everyone ready to make their wish now?
- Let's see.

19
00:01:02.966 --> 00:01:05.300
I hope I meet lots of strong trainers.

20
00:01:05.366 --> 00:01:07.700
I hope I win my third Princess Key.

21
00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:10.300
I hope I become a trainer soon.

22
00:01:10.933 --> 00:01:14.833
Uh, also, I hope my brother finds someone who's cute and smart

23
00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:16.733
to take care of him, and soon.

24
00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.966
- Bonnie!
- You better hurry up and make a wish, too!

25
00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:22.000
All right. What do I wish for?

26
00:01:22.433 --> 00:01:25.200
How about that everyone's wishes come true?

27
00:01:25.266 --> 00:01:28.900
Uh, Clemont, you could've come up with something more original.

28
00:01:35.933 --> 00:01:39.233
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

29
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.166
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

30
00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:47.066
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

31
00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:49.733
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

32
00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:51.400
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

33
00:01:51.466 --> 00:01:54.633
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

34
00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.866
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

35
00:01:57.933 --> 00:01:59.600
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

36
00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:15.300
I'm so tired. Good night.

37
00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:19.000
- Clemont, what have you got there?
- Oh, this?

38
00:02:19.066 --> 00:02:23.266
I invented an amazing alarm clock that's guaranteed to wake us up.

39
00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:26.333
That way, we'll be certain to make an early start.

40
00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.166
I can't wait to try it out.

41
00:03:03.666 --> 00:03:06.933
These guys are sawing so many logs I can't sleep.

42
00:03:07.966 --> 00:03:09.500
One Mareep...

43
00:03:10.566 --> 00:03:14.366
two Mareep, three Mareep, four Mareep,

44
00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.633
five Mareep,

45
00:03:17.133 --> 00:03:18.500
six Mareep,

46
00:03:19.033 --> 00:03:20.366
seven Mareep...

47
00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.633
eight Mareep...

48
00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:04.800
Pika.

49
00:04:06.966 --> 00:04:08.666
I can't eat anymore.

50
00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.733
Pika, Pikachu.

51
00:04:15.966 --> 00:04:18.733
Pika, Pika...

52
00:04:19.433 --> 00:04:21.166
Pi-- Pikachu.

53
00:04:21.633 --> 00:04:23.433
..105,

54
00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:27.233
skipping 10,000 to 10,106,

55
00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.500
10,107,

56
00:04:29.566 --> 00:04:31.766
10,108...

57
00:04:33.733 --> 00:04:35.166
Man, they're heavy!

58
00:04:37.833 --> 00:04:38.933
Oy.

59
00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:41.166
It was all just a dream.

60
00:04:41.633 --> 00:04:45.100
I thought I was being squished by a mountain of Mareep.

61
00:04:45.166 --> 00:04:47.266
I could sure use some water.

62
00:04:47.333 --> 00:04:48.866
Why am I so thirsty?

63
00:04:50.733 --> 00:04:53.133
I'm sure I saw a river nearby.

64
00:05:01.733 --> 00:05:04.966
- Pikachu.
- Pikachu?

65
00:05:05.366 --> 00:05:06.233
Pi.

66
00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.500
- Good morning!
- Pika?

67
00:05:11.566 --> 00:05:15.066
- Boy, oh, boy, I sure am thirsty.
- Yeah, me, too.

68
00:05:15.133 --> 00:05:16.500
Pi, Pika!

69
00:05:16.966 --> 00:05:20.200
What are you talking about? Remember? It's me.

70
00:05:20.266 --> 00:05:22.000
Pika, Pika!

71
00:05:22.066 --> 00:05:24.766
What's wrong, Pikachu? Do you have a fever?

72
00:05:24.833 --> 00:05:26.900
Not training enough, maybe?

73
00:05:26.966 --> 00:05:28.933
Pikachu. Pika, Pika.

74
00:05:29.466 --> 00:05:32.933
What are you talking about? We've always been able to speak.

75
00:05:35.433 --> 00:05:38.433
Come on. Stop with the goofing around.

76
00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.266
Pikachu's weird.

77
00:05:40.333 --> 00:05:42.466
I think it's still half-asleep.

78
00:05:43.233 --> 00:05:44.900
Pi! Pikachu!

79
00:05:44.966 --> 00:05:48.600
Pika! Pikachu!

80
00:05:51.833 --> 00:05:54.600
There's something screwy going on around here.

81
00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:56.733
This is wack! I gotta go!

82
00:05:59.533 --> 00:06:02.133
Pika, Pika! Pikachu!

83
00:06:04.933 --> 00:06:06.133
Pika, Pi!

84
00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:08.066
Pikachu! Pika, Pika!

85
00:06:08.133 --> 00:06:09.900
-Pika?

86
00:06:13.466 --> 00:06:16.300
Pika! Pika!

87
00:06:16.366 --> 00:06:17.800
Pikachu!

88
00:06:17.866 --> 00:06:19.800
What's going on?!

89
00:06:20.233 --> 00:06:23.300
Jessie. Come on, people. Come on, wake up, wake up!

90
00:06:28.266 --> 00:06:32.266
The twerps' Pokémon are evolving and changing, and that's not all!

91
00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:35.800
They're blabbing away like they're a bunch of dumb humans.

92
00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.033
Come on! This is no time for fooling around!

93
00:06:51.133 --> 00:06:54.833
They're acting like they're nuttier than they already are!

94
00:07:14.533 --> 00:07:17.766
- Pi, Pikachu.
- Hold on. You're not acting wacky.

95
00:07:17.833 --> 00:07:19.566
Hmm. Hmm. Hmm.

96
00:07:19.633 --> 00:07:22.300
You're the same dopey Pikachu you always are.

97
00:07:22.366 --> 00:07:23.500
Pikachu.

98
00:07:23.566 --> 00:07:26.600
- Everyone else is acting totally nuts.
- Pika, Pika.

99
00:07:26.666 --> 00:07:28.200
-Huh?

100
00:07:29.766 --> 00:07:31.966
- Pikachu.
- What's up, little buddy?

101
00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:35.966
'Tis the young man's Pikachu and Meowth from Team Rocket.

102
00:07:36.033 --> 00:07:37.200
- Huh?
- Pikachu!

103
00:07:37.266 --> 00:07:41.333
- The green slime can talk, too!
- My, my, does that astonish you?

104
00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:44.166
You, who is able to speak, as well?

105
00:07:44.233 --> 00:07:46.433
Hey, I've been speaking a long time.

106
00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:47.933
- Pika?
- Huh?

107
00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.800
I give. What's that about?

108
00:07:53.866 --> 00:07:55.766
It's been chasing me around.

109
00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:57.766
Huh?

110
00:07:57.833 --> 00:07:59.300
Save me at once!

111
00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.466
Come on, run!

112
00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.133
Pika.

113
00:08:08.633 --> 00:08:09.733
I'm running!

114
00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.300
I think if we hand over Squishy,

115
00:08:15.366 --> 00:08:17.733
it'll stop chasing us and we'll be off the hook!

116
00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:18.633
Pika, Pika.

117
00:08:22.066 --> 00:08:23.600
- Faster, faster!
- Pika!

118
00:08:23.666 --> 00:08:25.466
Oy vey!

119
00:08:32.133 --> 00:08:35.233
Now what are we gonna do? We hit a dead end!

120
00:08:35.299 --> 00:08:36.833
To the other side!

121
00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:37.966
Pikachu.

122
00:08:39.633 --> 00:08:40.900
Pika!

123
00:08:41.633 --> 00:08:44.233
I really don't like getting my paws wet.

124
00:08:45.066 --> 00:08:45.933
- Pika!
- Huh?

125
00:08:49.866 --> 00:08:52.400
Don't leave me, pal-y! Slow it down!

126
00:09:03.433 --> 00:09:05.100
Huh. Well done.

127
00:09:05.833 --> 00:09:09.866
I praise you both, young man's Pikachu and Meowth from Team Rocket.

128
00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.033
Pika, Pikachu?

129
00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:15.566
You know anything about that flaming bully?

130
00:09:15.633 --> 00:09:18.300
I said it's trying to catch me.

131
00:09:18.366 --> 00:09:21.833
Yeah, I got that already. But why does it wanna catch you?

132
00:09:22.333 --> 00:09:23.766
I have no idea.

133
00:09:23.833 --> 00:09:27.900
But one thing is for certain. Something unsavory is about to occur.

134
00:09:29.733 --> 00:09:30.666
Pika, Pika.

135
00:09:30.733 --> 00:09:34.066
I don't know what language you're speaking. It sure isn't mine.

136
00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.300
What I want is to be taken back home!

137
00:09:39.866 --> 00:09:42.533
Home? What do you mean by home?

138
00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:45.566
Listen. My power has not yet returned.

139
00:09:46.033 --> 00:09:50.066
If it does, the Order of Kalos will be thrown into disarray!

140
00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:53.300
I've got no idea what you're yapping about, pal.

141
00:09:53.366 --> 00:09:54.233
Pika, Pika.

142
00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:56.566
I understand. Touch me.

143
00:09:56.633 --> 00:09:58.066
Huh?

144
00:09:58.133 --> 00:09:59.066
Pika.

145
00:10:21.733 --> 00:10:24.366
Whoa, Pikachu. Stop! You're asleep!

146
00:10:25.033 --> 00:10:26.366
Pi? Pika?

147
00:10:26.433 --> 00:10:27.266
You okay?

148
00:10:27.833 --> 00:10:30.666
It sounds to me like Pikachu had a bad dream.

149
00:10:31.233 --> 00:10:32.066
Pikachu.

150
00:10:34.533 --> 00:10:37.833
- Pika, Pika!
- What's wrong, Pikachu? You're awake.

151
00:10:39.366 --> 00:10:41.766
- Look!
- Oh, no! Squishy's missing.

152
00:10:41.833 --> 00:10:44.766
Do you have any idea where Squishy went, Dedenne?

153
00:10:49.066 --> 00:10:51.033
- Pikachu!
- What's wrong, Pikachu?

154
00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:51.966
Hey, stop!

155
00:10:52.433 --> 00:10:56.600
- I think Pikachu went to look for Squishy.
- Let's go have a look, too. Come on.

156
00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:11.666
- What's going on, old chum?
- Have you been having a bad dream?

157
00:11:11.733 --> 00:11:16.066
And how. Squishy and I were being chased by some weird fire monster.

158
00:11:16.133 --> 00:11:19.700
Since it was a dream, why not take a deep breath and relax?

159
00:11:19.766 --> 00:11:20.766
Stop!

160
00:11:21.233 --> 00:11:25.266
No way it could've been a stinking dream. It was as real as I am.

161
00:11:25.733 --> 00:11:28.266
Oh, yeah. I gotta find Squishy.

162
00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:37.433
Pikachu, where are you?

163
00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:40.133
Hey, Squishy, where'd you go?

164
00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.600
Pika.

165
00:11:41.666 --> 00:11:43.233
I know it's this way.

166
00:11:45.466 --> 00:11:46.633
Pikachu.

167
00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:49.900
That place in the dream, I think it's around here.

168
00:12:00.066 --> 00:12:02.200
Who's that Pokémon?

169
00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:08.066
It's Darkrai!

170
00:12:14.066 --> 00:12:14.933
Pika.

171
00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.533
- Huh?!
- Pika!

172
00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:22.433
Pikachu.

173
00:12:22.933 --> 00:12:24.266
Pikachu.

174
00:12:24.333 --> 00:12:27.000
- It's the same as before.
- Pika, Pika.

175
00:12:27.066 --> 00:12:30.566
And that means you-know-who's gonna show up.

176
00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:32.266
Pi. Pikachu.

177
00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:34.500
Huh?

178
00:12:34.566 --> 00:12:35.733
Hmm.

179
00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:38.433
- You see? I knew it.
- Pikachu.

180
00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:41.733
Now I've gotta figure out if this is a dream or real.

181
00:12:42.166 --> 00:12:45.433
You! Where were you? We need to run!

182
00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.433
Huh?

183
00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:49.066
Is that thing gonna show its flames again?

184
00:12:49.133 --> 00:12:52.600
Of course. We have to hurry!

185
00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.333
Yikes! There's that big ball of fire!

186
00:12:57.333 --> 00:12:59.766
- Aah! Move it!
- Faster!

187
00:12:59.833 --> 00:13:01.633
Please, let this be a dream!

188
00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.000
Somebody help us out!

189
00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.500
- Huh? Hey.
- Pika.

190
00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.833
It looks like it gave up. Yes!

191
00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.166
Now I can catch up on some breathing.

192
00:13:20.233 --> 00:13:22.600
- Pikachu!
- Don't get too comfortable.

193
00:13:22.666 --> 00:13:24.733
- Huh?
- Let's go somewhere safe.

194
00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:27.433
- It could come for us any time!

195
00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.433
You don't relax much, do you?

196
00:13:31.766 --> 00:13:32.966
-Pika!

197
00:13:33.033 --> 00:13:34.833
Whoa, check out that mess!

198
00:13:40.233 --> 00:13:44.066
Uh, you think that flaming lunatic did all of this?

199
00:13:44.533 --> 00:13:47.733
I can't believe it would do this to just catch me.

200
00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:11.866
- Wow, that's crazy.
- Pika, Pika.

201
00:14:11.933 --> 00:14:13.733
Hey, what are you, anyway?

202
00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.000
I am I.

203
00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:16.966
Well, you're an amazing I.

204
00:14:17.033 --> 00:14:19.400
Forget all that. Let's get moving.

205
00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:25.033
Once we get through the forest, my home is very close.

206
00:14:27.133 --> 00:14:29.233
- We made it out.
- Pika!

207
00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.566
Huh?

208
00:14:35.166 --> 00:14:37.733
Something's suspicious about those clouds.

209
00:14:38.266 --> 00:14:41.066
Yes, it's coming, without a doubt. Let's hurry!

210
00:14:42.833 --> 00:14:46.733
Wait. If that happens, you can just turn into that powerful you.

211
00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.800
You could beat it like it was nothing.

212
00:14:53.266 --> 00:14:56.100
If I don't get back home, I can't transform.

213
00:14:57.400 --> 00:15:02.166
But as long as we get there in time, I promise you there's nothing to fear.

214
00:15:02.233 --> 00:15:04.666
Okay, let's put the pedal to the metal!

215
00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:14.066
- Stop here.
- How could that have happened?

216
00:15:15.233 --> 00:15:16.633
It beat us here.

217
00:15:17.566 --> 00:15:19.566
We have no choice but to fight!

218
00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:23.033
How are we supposed to fight fire, with fire?

219
00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:26.000
There's no weirdo like a burning weirdo.

220
00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:30.833
Come on, move!

221
00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.033
Don't be pushy!

222
00:15:36.066 --> 00:15:37.233
Hot! Hot, hot!

223
00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:38.166
Hot, hot, hot!

224
00:15:40.466 --> 00:15:43.333
- Pikachu?
- Thanks for asking, but I'm not.

225
00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:44.833
Pika, Pika.

226
00:15:47.366 --> 00:15:49.233
- Pikachu. Pika.
- Right.

227
00:15:50.166 --> 00:15:51.833
Pikachu!

228
00:16:04.166 --> 00:16:07.433
Pikachu!

229
00:16:18.133 --> 00:16:19.433
Pikachu!

230
00:16:21.866 --> 00:16:26.433
- Please, forgive our late arrival.
- I promise you can leave the rest to us.

231
00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.633
We'll do the battling from here on.

232
00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:30.633
Pika!

233
00:16:31.133 --> 00:16:33.633
Take this. Water pulse!

234
00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:37.166
Flamethrower!

235
00:16:40.666 --> 00:16:42.933
- Excellent. Good job!
- Pika.

236
00:16:45.366 --> 00:16:46.333
Double slap!

237
00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:50.966
This isn't working.

238
00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:58.200
- Don't worry. We'll help.
- Pancham and I will take over from here.

239
00:16:58.266 --> 00:17:00.266
Ha. Um.

240
00:17:00.333 --> 00:17:01.766
- Hey!
- Huh?

241
00:17:02.233 --> 00:17:04.333
That's not right!

242
00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:06.500
Stop eating my food!

243
00:17:07.133 --> 00:17:09.366
There's plenty to eat!

244
00:17:09.433 --> 00:17:12.000
So, what's the big deal, cheapskate?

245
00:17:12.466 --> 00:17:15.800
- Let's settle this by having a battle!
- You're on. Bring it!

246
00:17:15.866 --> 00:17:17.666
- Pika! Pika, Pikachu!
- Huh?

247
00:17:17.733 --> 00:17:20.866
Hey, what's the matter, Pikachu? Can't you evolve?

248
00:17:20.933 --> 00:17:23.266
- Pika, Pika.
- Pikachu says no.

249
00:17:23.333 --> 00:17:24.533
Well, I'll be.

250
00:17:25.066 --> 00:17:26.000
Huh?

251
00:17:26.433 --> 00:17:29.100
Come on!

252
00:17:29.166 --> 00:17:30.100
Listen!

253
00:17:30.166 --> 00:17:33.300
We'll battle after we take care of that hothead.

254
00:17:33.366 --> 00:17:34.200
Okay.

255
00:17:35.466 --> 00:17:37.433
Pin missile!

256
00:17:38.433 --> 00:17:40.266
Dark pulse.

257
00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:46.500
Pikachu!

258
00:17:47.366 --> 00:17:50.266
- All right. All right. All right.
- Good show.

259
00:17:50.333 --> 00:17:52.800
- That's showing it the old pepper!
- Yes.

260
00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:54.800
Pika, Pika.

261
00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:01.533
- Pika?
- Huh?

262
00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:02.633
Hmm?

263
00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:03.633
- Huh?
- Pika?

264
00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:06.033
- Hmm?
- Hold the phone. What's that noise?

265
00:18:26.266 --> 00:18:29.066
Huh? This is where we started.

266
00:18:29.766 --> 00:18:30.733
Pika?

267
00:18:31.166 --> 00:18:33.133
Does that mean this is reality?

268
00:18:34.333 --> 00:18:35.200
Pika.

269
00:18:36.233 --> 00:18:37.700
An explosion.

270
00:18:37.766 --> 00:18:39.933
Cha.

271
00:18:40.466 --> 00:18:42.433
Bonnie, did you hear that?

272
00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:43.833
Brai?

273
00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.500
That was one big bang of a bang boom.

274
00:18:47.566 --> 00:18:49.766
Hold on. Was your stomach growling?

275
00:18:49.833 --> 00:18:52.100
Don't be dumber than you already are!

276
00:18:52.166 --> 00:18:54.366
- Jessie! James!
- Huh?

277
00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.133
It's Meowth.

278
00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:59.566
- Where in the world have you been?
- I was in crazytown!

279
00:18:59.633 --> 00:19:02.366
This fiery monster tried to get us!

280
00:19:02.433 --> 00:19:05.400
And the Pokémon were all talking like people do.

281
00:19:05.466 --> 00:19:08.133
And those lugs could evolve when they wanted!

282
00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:10.533
- I can't take any more!
- Hmm.

283
00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:14.533
You know, you've been working too hard, old chum. Yes. Delirious.

284
00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:16.800
I think you should go back to sleep.

285
00:19:16.866 --> 00:19:19.133
I don't do sleep!

286
00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.200
No. I don't want that dream again!

287
00:19:23.433 --> 00:19:24.566
Aw!

288
00:19:25.566 --> 00:19:28.800
I guess it must've been the sound of your alarm clock.

289
00:19:28.866 --> 00:19:31.466
I don't think I can handle another failure.

290
00:19:31.533 --> 00:19:34.666
Wait. I'm sure it would've woken us up, wouldn't it?

291
00:19:34.733 --> 00:19:37.266
- I found Squishy!
- Huh?

292
00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:41.700
So, that's where you were.

293
00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:48.733
Squishy, please don't go running off like that anymore.

294
00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.133
Huh?

295
00:19:52.066 --> 00:19:53.333
That's Darkrai.

296
00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:01.633
Pika!

297
00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.766
Ah, Pikachu.

298
00:20:03.833 --> 00:20:06.533
Pika, Pika. Pikachu.

299
00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:14.633
Maybe Darkrai was behind Pikachu's dream.

300
00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:17.100
Yeah, maybe it created the whole thing.

301
00:20:18.433 --> 00:20:21.333
- Pikachu.
- So, what was your dream anyway?

302
00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.866
Pika. Pika, Pika.

303
00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:34.400
Because of Darkrai's mysterious power,

304
00:20:34.466 --> 00:20:37.466
Pikachu and Meowth became part of Squishy's dream.

305
00:20:37.933 --> 00:20:42.900
Thankfully, they were awakened because of Clemont's loud yet effective invention.

306
00:20:42.966 --> 00:20:46.833
But now the sun is up, and the journey continues.
